{"4704530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roll to Riches", "steam_appid": 4704530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4804900], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a settlement from nothing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from nothing. You gather enough wood to build your first campfire and shelter. From there, settlers will join you and merchants will arrive, allowing your city to thrive. <i><strong>Roll to Riches</strong></i> is an incremental city builder that allows you to build a thriving Viking city with a roll of the dice. Every building you raise and every worker you assign is a step toward economic prosperity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roll the dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resource gathered, grown, mined, or processed is determined by the roll of a die. Expand and improve to gain more and better dice. Build out your settlement, increase your population, and automate each dice roll with your villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7b9a5f3aa7c42a36bd7f74f63063f72e.poster.avif?t=1787725240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7b9a5f3aa7c42a36bd7f74f63063f72e.webm?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7b9a5f3aa7c42a36bd7f74f63063f72e.mp4?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade and expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once per minute, a traveling merchant arrives in town, ready to trade. The merchant brings tools for mining, seeds for farming, and sheep for shearing. Sell what your settlement produces and buy tools to construct new buildings or improve production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/c4b20f95a79333dda7ecc1e75c99e2f5.poster.avif?t=1787725240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/c4b20f95a79333dda7ecc1e75c99e2f5.webm?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/c4b20f95a79333dda7ecc1e75c99e2f5.mp4?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From fire pit to Viking trading hub</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay loop focuses on growth: build, roll, trade, and upgrade. As your wealth increases, so does your production. Can you develop your production chains and manage your resources effectively to make your ancestors proud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7aa8bfe00845d50ef6bf876d6b165f6b.poster.avif?t=1787725240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7aa8bfe00845d50ef6bf876d6b165f6b.webm?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7aa8bfe00845d50ef6bf876d6b165f6b.mp4?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a settlement from nothing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from nothing. You gather enough wood to build your first campfire and shelter. From there, settlers will join you and merchants will arrive, allowing your city to thrive. <i><strong>Roll to Riches</strong></i> is an incremental city builder that allows you to build a thriving Viking city with a roll of the dice. Every building you raise and every worker you assign is a step toward economic prosperity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roll the dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resource gathered, grown, mined, or processed is determined by the roll of a die. Expand and improve to gain more and better dice. Build out your settlement, increase your population, and automate each dice roll with your villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7b9a5f3aa7c42a36bd7f74f63063f72e.poster.avif?t=1787725240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7b9a5f3aa7c42a36bd7f74f63063f72e.webm?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7b9a5f3aa7c42a36bd7f74f63063f72e.mp4?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade and expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once per minute, a traveling merchant arrives in town, ready to trade. The merchant brings tools for mining, seeds for farming, and sheep for shearing. Sell what your settlement produces and buy tools to construct new buildings or improve production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/c4b20f95a79333dda7ecc1e75c99e2f5.poster.avif?t=1787725240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/c4b20f95a79333dda7ecc1e75c99e2f5.webm?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/c4b20f95a79333dda7ecc1e75c99e2f5.mp4?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From fire pit to Viking trading hub</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay loop focuses on growth: build, roll, trade, and upgrade. As your wealth increases, so does your production. Can you develop your production chains and manage your resources effectively to make your ancestors proud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7aa8bfe00845d50ef6bf876d6b165f6b.poster.avif?t=1787725240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7aa8bfe00845d50ef6bf876d6b165f6b.webm?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/extras/7aa8bfe00845d50ef6bf876d6b165f6b.mp4?t=1787725240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Gather, Build and Advance your settlement with every roll in the incremental city builder Roll to Riches. Mine iron, gather wood and cut stone to make your settlement prosper. Trade with merchants every minute and transform your small camp into a wealthy Norse empire.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/c94c16b3bb8e505ed0db06ff910327320e6eb9bb/header.jpg?t=1787725240", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704530/08e0f838ca062fed936a1cc662473b2e4a2ad103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787725240", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset